{
    "title": "NBC 7 San Diego News & Weather",
    "description": "The NBC 7 San Diego news and weather app connects you with local news, local weather and a free,  24/7 news streaming channel. Free to download and to use, the app delivers San Diego breaking news alerts and weather alerts for your location that can be customized and easily managed in the app settings. \r\n\r\nThe app gives you access to local news from the award-winning NBC 7 San Diego and Telemundo 20 news teams, covering the issues and concerns happening across San Diego County, North County, Chula Vista and other San Diego communities. The First Alert Weather Team delivers accurate local weather forecasts that keep app users safe and informed while on the go. Access a powerful weather radar, local traffic and border traffic updates, live updates on developing stories in San Diego and beyond.\r\n\r\nNBC 7 SAN DIEGO LOCAL WEATHER NEWS\r\n+Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange \r\n+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts\r\n+ First Alert Doppler, a weather radar owned by the station with exclusive features and data\r\n+ 10-day forecasts for your San Diego region \r\n+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph\r\n+ San Diego local weather maps and live weather radar  \r\n+ Local weather forecast data that includes San Diego UV index, airy quality and other live weather conditions \r\n+ Weather alerts for every location you save in the app\r\n+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists \r\n\r\nNBC 7 SAN DIEGO LOCAL NEWS AND ALERTS \r\n+Top News of the day, covering San Diego breaking news, politics, urgent product recalls and good news\r\n+San Diego border traffic cameras that show real-time stream of traffic at the U.S. - Mexico border and up-to-date wait times\r\n+ Latest San Diego local news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order\r\n+ Alerts for San Diego local news, California news, national headlines and world news that can be personalized and managed in the app settings\r\n+ Alerts Center that shows you the most urgent stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications\r\n+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in San Diego local news and in pop culture \r\n\r\nNBC 7 SAN DIEGO NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL \r\n+ Free 24/7 streaming channel for nonstop local San Diego news, weather and special coverage around the clock, wherever you are\r\n+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in Southern California\r\n+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed \r\n \r\nNBC 7 SAN DIEGO I-TEAM INVESTIGATIONS & MORE\r\n+ Investigative stories from local and award-winning San Diego journalists\r\n+ Consumer Reports from NBC 7 Responds team that advocates for San Diego consumers who have been cheated or swindled\r\n+ Entertainment and lifestyle videos from California Live, In Your Neighborhood and Ignite San Diego\r\n+ Sports news from NBC Sports Regional Sports Networks\r\n+ Business, finance and stock market news from CNBC\r\n+ Entertainment and celebrity news from E! Online and Access \r\n+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show\r\n\r\nNBC 7 San Diego and Telemundo 20 broadcast from Kearny Mesa, San Diego, and are owned by NBCUniversal as part of the NBCUniversal Local Owned Stations. NBC 7 first aired on Nov. 14, 1965, as the first independent television station KAAR on Channel 39 in San Diego. The station became NBC affiliate KNSD in 1988 and adopted the on-air brand \"Channel 7/39.\" NBC acquired KNSD in 1996, making it the only network-owned station in San Diego.\r\n\r\nThe NBC 7 San Diego news and weather app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=NBC_San_Diego/  \r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_San_Diego",
    "descriptionHTML": "The NBC 7 San Diego news and weather app connects you with local news, local weather and a free,  24/7 news streaming channel. Free to download and to use, the app delivers San Diego breaking news alerts and weather alerts for your location that can be customized and easily managed in the app settings. <br><br>The app gives you access to local news from the award-winning NBC 7 San Diego and Telemundo 20 news teams, covering the issues and concerns happening across San Diego County, North County, Chula Vista and other San Diego communities. The First Alert Weather Team delivers accurate local weather forecasts that keep app users safe and informed while on the go. Access a powerful weather radar, local traffic and border traffic updates, live updates on developing stories in San Diego and beyond.<br><br>NBC 7 SAN DIEGO LOCAL WEATHER NEWS<br>+Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange <br>+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts<br>+ First Alert Doppler, a weather radar owned by the station with exclusive features and data<br>+ 10-day forecasts for your San Diego region <br>+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph<br>+ San Diego local weather maps and live weather radar  <br>+ Local weather forecast data that includes San Diego UV index, airy quality and other live weather conditions <br>+ Weather alerts for every location you save in the app<br>+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists <br><br>NBC 7 SAN DIEGO LOCAL NEWS AND ALERTS <br>+Top News of the day, covering San Diego breaking news, politics, urgent product recalls and good news<br>+San Diego border traffic cameras that show real-time stream of traffic at the U.S. - Mexico border and up-to-date wait times<br>+ Latest San Diego local news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order<br>+ Alerts for San Diego local news, California news, national headlines and world news that can be personalized and managed in the app settings<br>+ Alerts Center that shows you the most urgent stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications<br>+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in San Diego local news and in pop culture <br><br>NBC 7 SAN DIEGO NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL <br>+ Free 24/7 streaming channel for nonstop local San Diego news, weather and special coverage around the clock, wherever you are<br>+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in Southern California<br>+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed <br> <br>NBC 7 SAN DIEGO I-TEAM INVESTIGATIONS &amp; MORE<br>+ Investigative stories from local and award-winning San Diego journalists<br>+ Consumer Reports from NBC 7 Responds team that advocates for San Diego consumers who have been cheated or swindled<br>+ Entertainment and lifestyle videos from California Live, In Your Neighborhood and Ignite San Diego<br>+ Sports news from NBC Sports Regional Sports Networks<br>+ Business, finance and stock market news from CNBC<br>+ Entertainment and celebrity news from E! Online and Access <br>+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show<br><br>NBC 7 San Diego and Telemundo 20 broadcast from Kearny Mesa, San Diego, and are owned by NBCUniversal as part of the NBCUniversal Local Owned Stations. NBC 7 first aired on Nov. 14, 1965, as the first independent television station KAAR on Channel 39 in San Diego. The station became NBC affiliate KNSD in 1988 and adopted the on-air brand &quot;Channel 7/39.&quot; NBC acquired KNSD in 1996, making it the only network-owned station in San Diego.<br><br>The NBC 7 San Diego news and weather app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.<br><br>Your Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&amp;intake=NBC_San_Diego/  <br>CA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_San_Diego",
